tanpa tertangkap CCTV?

700
00:39:38,000 --> 00:39:39,585
Itu sungguh mustahil.

701
00:39:39,668 --> 00:39:41,003
Jawabannya hanya satu.

702
00:39:45,216 --> 00:39:46,050
Gorong-gorong!

703
00:39:46,842 --> 00:39:47,760
Tunggu.

704
00:39:47,843 --> 00:39:50,846
Tim forensik pasti
sudah mencari secara menyeluruh.

705
00:39:50,930 --> 00:39:52,223
Tidak semuanya.

706
00:39:53,307 --> 00:39:56,060
Untuk mengetahui dasarnya,
kita harus ke sana.

707
00:39:56,602 --> 00:39:57,812
Ikut aku.

708
00:39:59,105 --> 00:40:00,564
Aku juga ikut?

709
00:40:00,648 --> 00:40:01,690
Kenapa? Tak mau?

710
00:40:02,191 --> 00:40:03,275
Pak Park…

711
00:40:03,984 --> 00:40:05,486
Tidak, aku mau.

712
00:40:05,569 --> 00:40:06,487
Aku sangat mau!

713
00:40:26,257 --> 00:40:28,717
Katamu kau mau? Sangat mau, 'kan?

714
00:40:32,972 --> 00:40:34,306
Aduh…

715
00:40:39,895 --> 00:40:41,897
Ada tangki udara
seharga 200.000 di Coupang.

716
00:40:42,898 --> 00:40:43,816
Lihat!

717
00:40:43,899 --> 00:40:45,693
Barangnya kukirim kilat. Besok saja.

718
00:40:46,193 --> 00:40:47,570
Aku pernah baca berita,

719
00:40:47,653 --> 00:40:50,281
ada orang mati keracunan
saat membersihkan gorong-gorong.

720
00:40:51,240 --> 00:40:52,575
- Minggir.
- Ya, baik.

721
00:40:56,078 --> 00:40:57,455
Kenapa diam saja?

722
00:40:58,664 --> 00:41:00,040
Oh, maaf.

723
00:41:02,460 --> 00:41:04,420
Masker gas, protofon, senter.

724
00:41:20,019 --> 00:41:21,854
Tak berguna aku menyuruhnya.

725
00:41:49,340 --> 00:41:50,299
DENAH GORONG-GORONG

726
00:41:50,382 --> 00:41:52,176
Terus jalan lurus.

727
00:41:52,259 --> 00:41:54,428
Jika ada lorong, belok kiri.

728
00:42:26,919 --> 00:42:31,131
<i>Lambat laun, kau akan lupa untuk bernapas.</i>

729
00:42:32,007 --> 00:42:35,636
<i>Aku hanya berada di tempat ini.</i>

730
00:42:36,679 --> 00:42:40,224
<i>Di kejauhan sana, terlihat pintu memori.</i>

731
00:42:41,225 --> 00:42:44,728
<i>Sekarang, buka pintunya sekuat tenaga.</i>

732
00:42:45,896 --> 00:42:47,106
<i>Satu,</i>

733
00:42:47,189 --> 00:42:48,232
<i>dua,</i>

734
00:42:48,315 --> 00:42:49,275
<i>tiga.</i>

735
00:42:49,358 --> 00:42:50,192
Aku ingat!

736
00:42:50,276 --> 00:42:51,986
Sial. Mengejutkan saja!

737
00:42:52,486 --> 00:42:53,612
Wah!

738
00:42:54,238 --> 00:42:55,948
Dulu aku pernah bertemu dia

739
00:42:57,491 --> 00:42:59,201
di acara diskon karyawan.

740
00:42:59,910 --> 00:43:00,786
Apa?

741
00:43:03,247 --> 00:43:04,081
Namanya…

742
00:43:04,164 --> 00:43:05,165
Siapa namanya?

743
00:43:05,249 --> 00:43:07,334
Sial. Namanya…

744
00:43:07,418 --> 00:43:09,420
Pak Park!

745
00:43:16,510 --> 00:43:18,846
TERKAIT PENGGUNA "DEWI CHEONGDAM"

746
00:43:18,929 --> 00:43:20,806
PERMINTAAN INFORMASI PENGGUNA

747
00:43:24,476 --> 00:43:27,479
NAMA PENGGUNA: DEWI CHEONGDAM
NAMA ASLI: MOK GA-HUI

748
00:43:29,148 --> 00:43:30,566
- Mok Ga-hui?
- Mok Ga-hui!

749
00:43:45,039 --> 00:43:48,834
STAF
MOK GA-HUI

750
00:45:13,502 --> 00:45:18,173
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Maharani Djenial

